---
import { stories } from '../data/gaap';
import Arrow from './Arrow.astro';
import Media from './Media.astro';
const albumStories = stories.filter((story) => ['rony-farofa', 'bella', 'ravena'].includes(story.id));
---
<section class="album-section section-space" aria-labelledby="album-title">
  <div class="container"><div class="album-heading" data-reveal><p class="eyebrow"><span class="chapter-number">04 /</span> um álbum de pequenos encontros</p><h2 id="album-title">Cada focinho,<br /><em>um universo.</em></h2><p>Tem história que começa com um resgate.<br />E continua com muita gente cuidando junto.</p></div>
    <div class="album-grid" data-album>{albumStories.map((story, index) => <article class:list={['album-item', `album-item-${index + 1}`]} data-album-item style={`--tilt:${[-5, 4, -3][index % 3]}deg; --album-index:${index}`}><a class="album-photo-link" href={story.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label={`Conhecer ${story.name} no Instagram`}><Media mediaId={story.mediaId} class="album-photo" fallbackTitle={story.name} /><span class="album-photo-number" aria-hidden="true">0{index + 1}</span></a><div class="album-caption"><div><p class="album-status">{story.statusLabel}</p><h3>{story.name}</h3></div><a href={story.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="circle-button" aria-label={`Ver publicação de ${story.name}`}><Arrow diagonal /></a></div><p class="album-story-copy">{story.summary}</p></article>)}</div>
    <p class="album-note">As histórias ficam. As informações de adoção podem mudar.<br />Consulte sempre as atualizações do GAAP no Instagram.</p>
  </div>
</section>
